        "faraidh_born_out_of_wedlock_desc": [.indonesian: "Nasab pewaris hanya tersambung ke ibu. Pihak ayah kandung dikecualikan.", .english: "Deceased lineage is established only through the mother. Father's side is excluded.", .malay: "Nasab si mati hanya bersambung ke ibu. Pihak bapa kandung dikecualikan."],
        "faraidh_born_out_of_wedlock_label": [.indonesian: "Lahir di luar nikah / Anak li'an", .english: "Born out of wedlock / Li'an", .malay: "Lahir di luar nikah / Anak li'an"],
        "faraidh_classical_al_akdariyah": [.indonesian: "Al-Akdariyah", .english: "Al-Akdariyah", .malay: "Al-Akdariyah"],
        "faraidh_classical_al_akdariyah_desc": [.indonesian: "Kasus yang kusut: kakek dan saudari kandung masing-masing mendapat 1/6 tetap, lalu menggabungkan dan membagi ulang total 2/6 dengan perbandingan 2:1 (kakek 2 bagian, saudari 1 bagian) — putusan Ibn Masʿūd dan Zayd ibn Thābit.", .english: "The muddled case: grandfather and full sister each receive 1/6 fixed, then pool and redivide their combined 2/6 in a 2:1 ratio (grandfather 2 parts, sister 1 part) — Ibn Masʿūd and Zayd ibn Thābit ruling.", .malay: "Kes yang kusut: datuk dan saudari kandung masing-masing mendapat 1/6 tetap, kemudian menggabung dan membahagi semula jumlah 2/6 dengan nisbah 2:1 (datuk 2 bahagian, saudari 1 bahagian) — hukum Ibn Masʿūd dan Zayd ibn Thābit."],
        "faraidh_classical_al_marwaniyah": [.indonesian: "Al-Marwaniyah", .english: "Al-Marwaniyah", .malay: "Al-Marwaniyah"],
        "faraidh_classical_al_marwaniyah_desc": [.indonesian: "Al-Mushtaraka: ʿUmar ibn Al-Khaṭṭāb (RA) memutuskan bahwa saudara kandung berbagi sama rata dengan saudara seibu dalam bagian 1/3 — berlaku dalam mazhab Mālikī.", .english: "Al-Mushtaraka: ʿUmar ibn Al-Khaṭṭāb (RA) ruled that full brothers share equally with maternal siblings in the 1/3 — applied in the Mālikī madhhab.", .malay: "Al-Mushtaraka: ʿUmar ibn Al-Khaṭṭāb (RA) memutuskan bahawa saudara kandung berkongsi sama rata dengan saudara seibu dalam 1/3 — diguna pakai dalam mazhab Mālikī."],
        "faraidh_classical_al_minbariyah": [.indonesian: "Al-Minbariyah", .english: "Al-Minbariyah", .malay: "Al-Minbariyah"],
        "faraidh_classical_al_minbariyah_desc": [.indonesian: "Kasus yang diajukan kepada ʿAlī ibn Abī Ṭālib (RA) saat di mimbar: bagian melebihi 1 sehingga ʿawl diterapkan — istri menerima ¼ dari hak normalnya.", .english: "The case posed to ʿAlī ibn Abī Ṭālib (RA) while on the minbar: shares exceed 1 so ʿawl applies — the wife receives ¼ of her normal entitlement.", .malay: "Kes yang dikemukakan kepada ʿAlī ibn Abī Ṭālib (RA) ketika di atas mimbar: bahagian melebihi 1 maka ʿawl digunakan — isteri menerima ¼ daripada haknya yang biasa."],
        "faraidh_classical_case_label": [.indonesian: "Kasus klasik", .english: "Classical case", .malay: "Kes klasik"],
        "faraidh_classical_umariyatain": [.indonesian: "Al-ʿUmariyatain", .english: "Al-ʿUmariyatain", .malay: "Al-ʿUmariyatain"],
        "faraidh_classical_umariyatain_desc": [.indonesian: "Dua putusan ʿUmar: ketika kedua orang tua dan pasangan hidup tanpa anak, ibu menerima 1/3 dari sisa (setelah bagian pasangan) — bukan 1/3 dari seluruh harta.", .english: "The two ʿUmari rulings: when both parents and a spouse survive with no children, the mother receives 1/3 of the residue (after the spouse's share) — not 1/3 of the whole estate.", .malay: "Dua putusan ʿUmar: apabila kedua ibu bapa dan pasangan masih hidup tanpa anak, ibu menerima 1/3 daripada baki (selepas bahagian pasangan) — bukan 1/3 daripada keseluruhan harta."],
